Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.34,0:01:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是华盛顿来的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the guys from Washington?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.18,0:01:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方还有别人来吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get many other visitors out here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.10,0:01:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到这儿多久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long you been on site?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.72,0:01:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上就到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.18,0:01:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,18小时前 一个俄罗斯石油小队发现的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Russian oil team called it in about 18 hours ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.23,0:01:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前怎么没发现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come nobody's spotted it before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.73,0:01:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么好奇怪的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's really not that surprising.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.61,0:01:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的地貌一直在变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This landscapes changing all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.98,0:01:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这到底是什么玩意吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got any idea what this thing is exactly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.53,0:01:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 可能是个气象气球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, it's probably a weather balloon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.57,0:01:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.86,0:01:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有专用的设备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know we don't have the equipment for a job like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.82,0:01:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候才能开始挖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long before we can start craning it out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.49,0:01:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你还没搞清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you quite understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.41,0:01:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得要一架终极起重机才行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are going to need one hell of a crane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.55,0:02:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,总部 我们进去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Base, we're in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.76,0:02:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.28,0:02:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.26,0:03:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,中尉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lieutenant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.05,0:03:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么 - 天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - My god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.31,0:03:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,总部 帮我接上校{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Base, give me a line to the Colonel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.60,0:03:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是凌晨三点 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 3am, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.06,0:03:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不管现在几点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what time it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.23,0:03:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经等得够久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one's waited long enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.41,0:03:44.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（1942年3月 挪威 滕斯贝格市）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.96,0:03:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've come for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.21,0:03:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前也来过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.59,0:03:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次不一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.26,0:03:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.55,0:04:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们找不到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll never find it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.76,0:04:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,快打开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.52,0:04:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么就找不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't you find it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.95,0:05:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我花了很久才找到这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has taken me a long time to find this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.16,0:05:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是不得不称赞你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be commended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.00,0:05:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,扶他起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help him up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.27,0:05:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你是个很有远见的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that you are a man of great vision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.67,0:05:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这点我们很像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in this way we are much alike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.33,0:05:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们根本不像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am nothing like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.47,0:05:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 但其他人看做是迷信的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course but what others see as superstition, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.22,0:05:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你我却都认为是科学{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you and I know to be as science.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.93,0:05:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要找的东西并不存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you seek is just a legend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.90,0:05:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又何必这么大费周章地藏起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why make such an effort to conceal it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.96,0:06:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,超立方体是奥丁的瑰宝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tesseract was the jewel of Odin's treasure room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.93,0:06:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西不该被藏起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not something one buries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.14,0:06:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我觉得已经很接近了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think it is close, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.02,0:06:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮不了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.35,0:06:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.06,0:06:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也许你能帮帮你的村子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But maybe you can help your, uh village?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.36,0:06:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里一定有你的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have some friends out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.90,0:06:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能还有一些小孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some little grandchildren, perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.07,0:06:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你不希望他们死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no need for them to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.90,0:06:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊戈德拉希尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yggdrasil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.22,0:06:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界之树{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Tree of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.18,0:06:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,守护着智慧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guardian of wisdom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.43,0:06:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有命运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And fate also.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.55,0:07:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,元首竟还在沙漠里挖破烂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Fürer digs for trinkets in the desert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.43,0:07:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定没见过这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have never seen this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.27,0:07:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.81,0:07:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是给凡人看的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not for the eyes of ordinary men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.77,0:07:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.57,0:07:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,下令开火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give the order to open fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.80,0:07:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,蠢货{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.58,0:07:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你驾驭不了那种力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot control the power you hold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.08,0:07:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会下地狱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will burn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.16,0:08:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经见过地狱了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.43,0:08:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克尔·奥康纳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}O'Connell, Michael.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.14,0:08:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利·卡明斯基{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kaminski, Henry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.14,0:08:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 死了这么多人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, a lot of guys getting killed over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.81,0:08:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂文·罗杰斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rogers, Stephen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.56,0:08:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下你是不是有点退缩了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kinda makes you think twice about enlisting, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.69,0:08:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.07,0:08:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗杰斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rogers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.74,0:08:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲因什么过世{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did your father die of?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.83,0:08:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,芥子气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mustard gas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.21,0:08:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他曾服役于107步兵团{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was in the 107th infantry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.96,0:08:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也希望能被指派到… - 你母亲呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was hoping I could be assigned. - Mother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.34,0:08:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是结核病房的护士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was a nurse in a TB ward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.13,0:08:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,她被传染了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got hit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.71,0:08:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没挺过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't shake it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.59,0:08:53.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（病例汇总：猩红热 风湿热 慢性或急性伤寒 高血压 心悸 乏力 心脏病等）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.76,0:08:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.01,0:08:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我个机会吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well just give me a chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.14,0:08:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,光哮喘这一项就不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be ineligible on your asthma alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.14,0:09:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不能做些什么吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything you can do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.43,0:09:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm doing it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.14,0:09:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在救你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saving your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.20,0:09:06.19,Note,0,0,0,0,,（不合格）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.57,0:09:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,战火继续肆虐欧洲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}War continues to ravage Europe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.03,0:09:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但援兵已经准备就绪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But help is on the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.74,0:09:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有适龄青年都应参军报效国家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every able bodied young man is lining up to serve his country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.33,0:09:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,就连小蒂米也出力了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even little Timmy is doing his part.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.25,0:09:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮忙收集废金属{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Collecting scrap metal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.33,0:09:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好 蒂米{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice work, Timmy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.67,0:09:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁关心这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who cares!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.96,0:09:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧放电影{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play the movie already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.47,0:09:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,放尊重点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, want to show some respect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.59,0:09:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,与此同时 海外战场上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meanwhile, over seas…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.63,0:09:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇敢的士兵们正让轴心国明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Our brave boys are showing the Axis Powers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.39,0:09:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了自由他们能付出一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…That the price of freedom is never to high.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.10,0:09:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 别放了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, get on with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.27,0:09:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快放动画片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, just start the cartoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.10,0:09:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you want to shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.06,0:09:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要盟军齐心协力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together with allied forces, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.61,0:09:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能克服一切困难{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll face any threat, no matter the size.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.79,0:10:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是怎么也不放弃是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just don't know when to give up, do you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.00,0:10:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以和你耗一整天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do this all day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.43,0:10:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 别恃强凌弱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, pick on someone your own size.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.36,0:10:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候我觉得你就是喜欢挨揍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes I think you like getting punched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.07,0:10:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就要打败他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had him on the ropes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.36,0:10:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要来多少次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.36,0:10:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次是帕拉姆斯人啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, your from Paramus now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.70,0:10:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道在征兵表上造假是违法的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know it's illegal to lie on your enlistment form.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.29,0:10:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然还有新泽西 真的假的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, Jersey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.71,0:10:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你接到命令了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get your orders?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.71,0:10:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,107步兵团{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}107th.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.17,0:10:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·巴恩斯中士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sergeant James Barnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.84,0:10:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,明早起航开赴英格兰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shipping out for England first thing tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.51,0:11:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也该一起去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should be going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.81,0:11:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 哥们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.27,0:11:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我参军前的最后一晚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.81,0:11:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,先帮你换身行头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta get you cleaned off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.15,0:11:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 我们要去哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, where we going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.98,0:11:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.55,0:11:15.17,Note,0,0,0,0,,（明日世界世博会）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.94,0:11:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没觉得有什么问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see what the problem is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.24,0:11:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约所有的男人都去当兵了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're about to be the last eligible man in New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.99,0:11:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还剩下三百五十万女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know there's three and a half million women here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.49,0:11:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我只需要一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'd settle for just one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.66,0:11:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好在我已经搞定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good thing I took care of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.71,0:11:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,鹿仔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Bucky!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.00,0:11:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么和她说我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you tell her about me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.42,0:11:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是好话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the good stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.92,0:11:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到现代奇迹展馆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the Modern Marvels Pavilion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.63,0:11:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,明日世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the world of tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.85,0:11:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,更强大的世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A greater world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.56,0:11:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,更完美的世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A better world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.69,0:11:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.94,0:11:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's starting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.69,0:11:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and Gentlemen, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.78,0:11:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,有请霍华德·史塔克先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Howard Stark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.75,0:12:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and Gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.96,0:12:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我告诉你就在短短几年后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I told you that in just a few short years, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.34,0:12:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的汽车就再也不用碰到地面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your automobile won't even have to touch the ground, at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.72,0:12:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.01,0:12:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 曼蒂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Mandy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.26,0:12:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要有史塔克的反重力科技{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With Starks Gravitic reversion technology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.77,0:12:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切都将成为可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be able to do just that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.19,0:12:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的神啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy cow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.87,0:12:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了还要再过几年是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well I did say a few years, didn't I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.43,0:13:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂夫 我们请这些女孩去…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Steve. What do you say we treat these girls…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.69,0:13:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 大兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.11,0:13:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 不然还叫什么双人约会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, kinda missing the point of a double date.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.41,0:13:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去跳舞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're taking the girls dancing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.95,0:13:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去吧 我一会来找你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go ahead, I'll catch up with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.08,0:13:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真要再试一次吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really gonna do this again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.83,0:13:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正这是嘉年华 就当我碰碰运气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well it's a fair, I'm going to try my luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.13,0:13:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次又是哪 俄亥俄州吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As who, Steve from Ohio?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.33,0:13:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会逮住你 要是他们招了你就更糟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll catch you or worse they'll actually take you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.59,0:13:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你觉得我不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look I know you don't think I can do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.13,0:13:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是打架 史蒂夫 这是打仗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a back alley, Steve, it's war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.88,0:13:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道这是打仗 - 那就去找点事做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know it's a war. - Then find something to fight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.76,0:13:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,先去找份工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Start looking for a job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.89,0:13:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你觉得我能干什么 捡垃圾吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I going to do, collect scrap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.77,0:13:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我知道…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I know that I'm…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.60,0:13:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想去工厂 鹿仔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going to sit in a factory, Bucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.27,0:13:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,鹿仔 拜托了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bucky come on, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.50,0:13:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都在战场上拼命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there are men laying down their lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.56,0:13:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能躲在后方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got no right to do any less than them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.10,0:13:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会了解这点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.81,0:14:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是想证明什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't about me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.15,0:14:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,才怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.57,0:14:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是想证明自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause you got nothing to prove.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.36,0:14:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 我们还去跳舞吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey sorry. Are we going dancing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.12,0:14:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.88,0:14:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,别干傻事 等我回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do anything stupid until I get back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.42,0:14:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.59,0:14:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把傻气都带走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're taking all the stupid with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.38,0:14:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个混球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a punk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.64,0:14:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才混球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jerk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.80,0:14:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.77,0:14:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我到了再打赢战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't win the war 'til I get there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.65,0:14:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 姑娘们 我们去跳舞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on girls, playing our song.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.71,0:15:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这等着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.01,0:15:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a problem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.34,0:15:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这等着就是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wait here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.34,0:15:12.47,Note,0,0,0,0,,（伪造征兵资料是违法的）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.36,0:15:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.58,0:15:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.37,0:15:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想到国外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to go overseas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.91,0:15:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,去杀鬼子吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill some Nazis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.25,0:15:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.75,0:15:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是亚伯罕·厄斯金博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor Abraham Erskine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.84,0:15:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,战略科学预备役部门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I represent a Strategic Scientific Reserve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.84,0:15:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂夫·罗杰斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve Rogers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.26,0:15:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是哪里人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.14,0:15:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇后区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Queens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.56,0:15:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌托邦大道第73街{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}73rd street and Utopla parkway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.77,0:15:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那之前 是德国人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before that, Germany.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.69,0:16:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会让你困扰吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This troubles you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.40,0:16:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.69,0:16:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又是哪里人 罗杰斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you from, Mr. Rogers? Hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.32,0:16:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是纽黑文市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it, New Haven?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.99,0:16:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是帕拉姆斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or, Paramus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.41,0:16:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,五份文件上写了五个不同城市…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five exams in five different cities…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.49,0:16:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,文件可能拿错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might not be the right file.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.20,0:16:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感兴趣的不是文件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not the exams I'm interested in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.16,0:16:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是你尝试了五次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the five tries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.66,0:16:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你还没回答我的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you didn't answer my question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.71,0:16:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想去杀鬼子吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to kill Nazis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.51,0:16:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是测试吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this a test?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.30,0:16:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.84,0:16:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想杀任何人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to kill anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.31,0:16:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想当恶霸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like bullies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.14,0:16:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是哪里的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care where they're from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.06,0:16:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经有很多大个子参战了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there are already so many big men fighting this war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.77,0:16:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不妨加一个小个子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe what we need now is a little guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.73,0:16:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以给你一个机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can offer you a chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.61,0:16:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是一个机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only a chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.78,0:16:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接受{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.99,0:16:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.74,0:16:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么这个小个子从哪来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where is the little guy from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.50,0:17:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.37,0:17:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁克林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brooklyn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.08,0:17:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.84,0:17:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,大兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.84,0:17:09.84,Note,0,0,0,0,,（一等）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.53,0:17:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗 佐拉博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you ready, Doctor Zola?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.45,0:17:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这台仪器需要精确无比的校准{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The machine requires the most delicate calibration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.58,0:17:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,请原谅 我不得不确保万无一失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me if I seem over cautious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.12,0:17:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定那些士兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you certain that those combatants of yours{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.33,0:17:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,能承受这种能量激增{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…can withstand the energy surge, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.59,0:17:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,能接受这种变形吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…strong enough for a transference?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.71,0:17:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个装置面前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With this artifact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.76,0:17:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都不能确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am certain of nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.59,0:17:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我担心它完全不起作用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear it may not work at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.01,0:18:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,百分之二十{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty percent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.47,0:18:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,四十{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.39,0:18:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,六十{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sixty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.73,0:18:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳定在百分之七十{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stabilizing at seventy percent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.60,0:18:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我花了这么多功夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have not come all this way, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.90,0:18:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是为了安全 博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for safety, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.92,0:19:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.00,0:19:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要恭喜你 阿尔宁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must congratulate you, Arnim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.22,0:19:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的设计没有让我失望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your designs does not disappoint.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.51,0:19:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然还需要一点加固{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though they may require some slight reinforcement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.52,0:19:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,转换过程很稳定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The transmittion is stable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.23,0:19:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,太神奇了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amazing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.31,0:19:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的那个能量源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The energy patch, you called it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.65,0:19:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,使我所有的设计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}equipped all my designs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.52,0:19:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成了现实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All my designs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.61,0:19:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这将改变这场战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will change the war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.28,0:19:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐拉博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor Zola.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.33,0:19:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这将改变整个世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will change the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.54,0:19:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,新兵们 立正{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recruits, attention!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.38,0:19:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 我是卡特特工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, I'm Agent Carter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.42,0:19:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我负责监督该部门的所有事务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I supervise all operations for this division.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.47,0:20:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的口音怎么了 维多利亚女王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with the accent, Queen Victoria?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.43,0:20:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为我是为美军效力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought I was signing up for the U.S. Army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.72,0:20:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字 大兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name, soldier?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.01,0:20:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉尔默·霍奇 女王陛下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gilmore Hodge, your majesty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.97,0:20:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,上前一步 霍奇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step forward, Hodge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.31,0:20:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,右脚再上前一步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your right foot forward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.77,0:20:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要格斗吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gonna wrestle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.32,0:20:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可有个你会喜欢的招式哟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I gotta a few moves I know you'll like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.53,0:20:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特特工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Carter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.49,0:20:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲利普斯上校{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel Phillips.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.49,0:20:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你和我们的新兵打成一片啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see that you are breaking in the candidates, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.87,0:20:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.20,0:20:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的屁股从地上挪开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your ass up out of that dirt, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.79,0:20:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后归队站好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…And stand up in that lineup at attention until, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.08,0:20:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,站到有人让你停为止{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…somebody comes and tells you what to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.67,0:20:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.00,0:20:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴顿将军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Patton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.51,0:20:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经说过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.22,0:20:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,「战争取决于武器 但战胜取决于士兵」 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"War's are fought with weapons but they are won by men."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.84,0:20:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会打赢这场仗 因为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are going to win this war, because…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.85,0:20:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有最优秀的士兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we have the best men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.85,0:20:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他们会越来越好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And because they're gonna get better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.81,0:20:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好得多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much, better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.73,0:20:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,战略科学预备队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Strategic Scientific Reserve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.11,0:21:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是由各国同盟组成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is an allied effort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.78,0:21:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,由自由世界的精英们组成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made up with the best minds of the free world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.16,0:21:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our goal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.49,0:21:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是建立史上最优秀的军队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is to create the best army in history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.99,0:21:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,而所有军队都有一个先行者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But every army starts with one man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.29,0:21:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗杰斯 快起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rogers! Get up from there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.50,0:21:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这周过后 我们就要选出那个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the end of this week, we will chose that man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.25,0:21:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他将会是第一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be the first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.79,0:21:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们新一代的超级战士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our new breed of super soldiers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.01,0:21:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗杰斯 快从那爬出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rogers, get your ass out of that line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.39,0:21:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他们 将亲手把阿道夫·希特勒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they, will personally escort Adolph Hitler{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.93,0:21:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,送进地狱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Through the gates of hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.35,0:21:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟上 姑娘们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick up the pace, ladies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.85,0:21:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.40,0:21:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Double time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.11,0:21:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 跑快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, faster, faster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.94,0:21:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,动起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.20,0:21:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,动起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.70,0:21:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,立定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Squad halt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.99,0:21:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这面旗子说明你们只跑了一半{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That flag means you're only at the half way point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.29,0:21:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一个拿到旗子的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First man to bring it to me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.70,0:21:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能和卡特特工一起搭车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}gets to ride back with Agent Carter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.62,0:21:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.29,0:21:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 爬上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, get up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.67,0:22:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就这点能耐吗 这支部队完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you got? This army is in trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.30,0:22:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,上去啊 霍奇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up there, Hodge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.22,0:22:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,上啊 爬上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, get up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.43,0:22:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,17年来没人能拿到那面旗子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's got that flag in seventeen years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.52,0:22:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 排队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, fall in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.73,0:22:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 回来排好队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, get back in a formation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.65,0:22:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗杰斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rogers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.65,0:22:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说排队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, fall in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.08,0:22:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.47,0:22:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 姑娘们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faster ladies, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.85,0:22:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,连我奶奶都比你们强力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grandmother has more life in her, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.99,0:22:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝保佑她 动起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God rest her soul. Move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.85,0:22:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是真想选罗杰斯吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not really thinking of picking Rogers, are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.02,0:23:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是想 我已经决定选他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am more than just thinking about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.02,0:23:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个明智的选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a clear choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.23,0:23:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时把个90磅的哮喘病猫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you brought a 90 pounds{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.40,0:23:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,带进我部队的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}modicum asthmatic onto my army base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.19,0:23:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没反对 我想管他呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I let it slide. I thought what the hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.03,0:23:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你只把他当做小白鼠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he could be useful to you, like a gerbil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.78,0:23:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我从没想过你会选他 - 起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Never thought you'd pick him. - Up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.54,0:23:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这孩子的胳膊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stick a needle in that kids arm, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.89,0:23:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,比面条都细{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's going to go right through him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.37,0:23:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 姑娘们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, girls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.04,0:23:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.17,0:23:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看着他都快哭了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's making me cry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.75,0:23:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更看重品质 而不是体型{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am looking for qualities beyond the physical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.84,0:23:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我们为这项目付出多少心血{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how long it took to set up this project.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.13,0:23:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道 - 我还不得不对那些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - All the groveling I had to do in front…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.88,0:23:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,天知道叫什么名字的狗屁委员会低声下气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of Senator whats-his-name committees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.97,0:23:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我清楚你付出了多少努力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I know. I am well aware of your efforts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.01,0:23:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就给我点回报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then throw me a bone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.10,0:23:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍奇通过了所有测试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hodge passed every test we gave him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.35,0:23:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他强壮 动作又快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's big, he's fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.56,0:23:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他遵守命令 是个军人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He obeys orders, he's a soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.23,0:23:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个恶霸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a bully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.06,0:23:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠善良可打不了胜仗 博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't win wars with niceness, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.36,0:23:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,打胜仗 靠的是胆量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You win wars, with guts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.15,0:23:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,有手榴弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grenade!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.33,0:23:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.49,0:23:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.50,0:24:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是假手榴弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phony grenade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.17,0:24:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,警报解除 归队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All clear, back in formation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.05,0:24:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是测试吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this a test?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.02,0:24:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还是太瘦弱了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still skinny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.69,0:24:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能进来吗 - 当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- May I? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.70,0:24:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡不着吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't sleep?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.70,0:24:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是紧张吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got the jitters I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.12,0:24:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, me too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.20,0:24:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能问个问题吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I ask you a question?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.75,0:24:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一个吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.46,0:24:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么选我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.80,0:24:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要这一个问题就够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose that is the one question that matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.72,0:24:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个产自奥格斯堡（德国城市）{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is from Augsburg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.81,0:24:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的故乡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My City.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.52,0:25:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人都忘了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So many people forget that the{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.98,0:25:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳粹第一个侵略的就是自己的国家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}first country the Nazi's invaded was their own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.77,0:25:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一战结束后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know after the last war they, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.23,0:25:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的同胞们生活在水深火热中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}my peoples struggled, they…They…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.90,0:25:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们感到无能为力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They felt weak, they felt…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.28,0:25:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后希特勒出现了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…slow, then Hitler comes along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.70,0:25:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,军队 党旗 大肆宣扬 各种煽动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the marching and the big show, and the flags and all that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.49,0:25:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着他听说了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he, hears of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.91,0:25:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我的工作 他找到了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My work, and he finds me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.66,0:25:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说 你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he says, you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.04,0:25:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要让我们变强{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says, you will make us strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.79,0:25:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我不感兴趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not interested.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.55,0:25:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把我送到海德拉总部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he sends the head of Hydra.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.26,0:25:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,东线研究部门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}East research division.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.34,0:25:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有位天才科学家 叫约翰·施密特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A brilliant Scientist by the name of, Johann Schmidt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.35,0:25:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在施密特已经是核心成员了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now Schmidt is a member of the inner circle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.97,0:25:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他野心勃勃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's ambitious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.68,0:25:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他甚至和希特勒一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even Hitler shares his passion for, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.27,0:25:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,痴迷于超能力和大陆神话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}occult power and tatanic myth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.73,0:25:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,希特勒用他的幻想煽动他的追随者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hitler uses his fantasies to inspire his followers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.82,0:25:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,而对施密特来说那不是幻想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for Schmidt it is not fantasy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.11,0:25:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,对他来说 这是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For him, it is real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.03,0:25:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他相信在这个世界上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has become convinced that there is a great power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.91,0:25:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐藏着一股强大的力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hidden in the earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.37,0:26:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是众神留下的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left here by the gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.45,0:26:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,有待一个超人去发现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiting to be seized by superior men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.54,0:26:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以当他发现我血清配方的能耐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So when he has found my formula and what it can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.25,0:26:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他无法抗拒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He cannot resist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.76,0:26:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,施密特想成为那个超人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Schmidt wants to become that superior man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.93,0:26:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他变强了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did it make him stronger?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.27,0:26:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ja.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.73,0:26:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过也有副作用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, it has other effects.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.40,0:26:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那血清还未完全成熟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The serum wasn't ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.44,0:26:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但更重要的是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But more important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.61,0:26:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是使用的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.49,0:26:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,血清能增强人的各个方面 所以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The serum amplifies everything that is inside, so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.91,0:26:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的变得更好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good becomes great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.99,0:26:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏的则变得更坏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad becomes worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.13,0:26:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我选择了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is why you were chosen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.92,0:26:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为强者的力量与生俱来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because a strong man who has known power all his life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.72,0:26:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们失去了对力量的敬畏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They lose respect for that power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.55,0:26:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,而弱者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a weak man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.84,0:27:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,才懂得力量的价值{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who values of strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.43,0:27:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有爱心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And loves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.60,0:27:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂得怜悯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Compassion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.23,0:27:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 虽然不太懂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.32,0:27:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,来喝点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.99,0:27:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管明天发生什么 答应我一件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever happens tomorrow, you must promise me one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.87,0:27:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远别忘了你是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you must stay who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.58,0:27:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要当一个好兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a perfect soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.92,0:27:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,而要当{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.09,0:27:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个好人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A good man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.51,0:27:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬小个子们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the little guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.81,0:27:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢着 看我做了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait, wait. What am I doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.39,0:27:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明天要进行测试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you have procedure tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.06,0:27:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能喝酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No fluids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.69,0:27:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那我们以后再喝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we'll drink it after.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.69,0:27:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我明天又不用测试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't have procedure tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.61,0:27:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不用等 我现在就喝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't after, I can now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.72,0:28:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么特别需要吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there something in particular you need?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.52,0:28:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说你找到他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I uh, understand you found him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.07,0:28:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己看吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See for yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.96,0:28:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不赞成吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You disapprove.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.04,0:28:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是不明白你为什么要在意他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't see why you need concern yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.09,0:28:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不可能成功{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't imagine he'll succeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.51,0:28:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,再次成功{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.55,0:28:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,血清是同盟国最后的防线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The serum is the allies only defense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.80,0:28:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,来抵抗我们掌握了的力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}against this power we now possess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.60,0:28:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是我们将其摧毁 就能确保胜利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we take it away from them, then our victory is assured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.40,0:28:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我要下令吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall I give the order?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.15,0:29:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经下令了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has been given.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.24,0:29:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.57,0:29:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐拉博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor Zola.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.45,0:29:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.67,0:29:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Masterpiece.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.27,0:29:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个街区我很熟悉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know this neighborhood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.31,0:29:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在那条巷子里被打过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got beat up in that alley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.19,0:29:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那个停车场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that parking lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.61,0:29:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那个餐厅后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And behind that dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.07,0:29:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不逃跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you have something against running away?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.16,0:29:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是跑了一次 就会一直跑下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You start running they'll never let you stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.62,0:29:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你要是站起来反击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stand up, push back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.75,0:29:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天会有机会的吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't say no forever, right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.71,0:29:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你有一点同感{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know a little of what that's like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.67,0:30:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是被拒绝的感觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To have every door shut in your face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.21,0:30:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白你为什么要参军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I just don't know why you would want to join the army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.71,0:30:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是位漂亮的女士 我是说漂亮的女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a beautiful dame. Beautifu…Oh a woman. I mean…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.30,0:30:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是位特工 不是女士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An agent, not a Dame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.22,0:30:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.97,0:30:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道怎么跟女人搭讪吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea how to talk to a woman, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.43,0:30:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这大概是我和女人的最长一次对话了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this is the longest conversation I've had with a woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.73,0:30:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们才不愿意和一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not exactly lining{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.83,0:30:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,会踩到她们脚的男人跳舞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}up to dance with a guy that might step on them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.61,0:30:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定跳过舞吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have danced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.27,0:30:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢邀女人跳舞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, asking a woman to dance always seems so terrifying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.65,0:30:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这么些年过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the past few years just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.74,0:30:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经不怎么在意了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't seem to matter that much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.45,0:30:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我在等吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figured I'd wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.16,0:30:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,等什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.79,0:30:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,合适的舞伴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right partner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.68,0:30:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.56,0:30:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来这儿干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.43,0:30:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.80,0:31:00.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（布鲁克林古董店）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.95,0:31:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天天气很棒吧 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wonderful weather this morning. Isn't it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.20,0:31:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但我总是带着伞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but I always carry an umbrella.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.80,0:32:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.39,0:32:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 别拍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, not now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.10,0:32:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.77,0:32:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.44,0:32:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱掉衬衣和领带 摘掉帽子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take off your shirt your tie and your hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.28,0:32:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,布兰德议员 很高兴你能来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senator Brandt, glad you could make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.12,0:32:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到底来这儿干什么来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why exactly am I in Brooklyn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.04,0:32:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要使用城市电网{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We needed access to the cities power grid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.83,0:32:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然如果你之前批准了我的申请{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course if you had given me a generalized requisition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.91,0:32:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人都在申请经费{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of people are asking for funds, …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.42,0:32:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是克雷…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this is Clem uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.79,0:32:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷格·克雷姆森 国务院的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gregg Clemson, state department.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.17,0:32:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们的项目获得成功{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this project of yours comes through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.13,0:32:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可不能让媒体抢了先机啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd like to see that it doesn't get into the headlines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.88,0:32:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.97,0:32:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,给那孩子吃点东西吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody get that kid a sandwich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.65,0:33:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,舒服吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Comfortable?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.78,0:33:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a little big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.11,0:33:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那酒有没有给我留{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You save me any of that schnapps?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.83,0:33:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没留多少{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not as much as I should have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.24,0:33:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 下次吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, next time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.25,0:33:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,史塔克先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Stark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.46,0:33:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,基线如何{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are your levels?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.71,0:33:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 100% - 很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Levels at 100%. - Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.84,0:33:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可能会用掉布鲁克林一半电力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We may dim half the lights in Brooklyn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.30,0:33:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们准备好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we are ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.51,0:33:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一如既往{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good as we'll ever be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.30,0:33:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特特工 要是你待在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Carter, don't you think{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.76,0:33:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制室里会不会更好点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you would be more comfortable in the booth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.93,0:33:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh yes, ah, sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.94,0:33:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,能听到吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you hear me, is this on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.45,0:33:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们 先生们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and Gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.07,0:34:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我们不是进一步走向灭绝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today we take not another step towards annihilation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.08,0:34:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是迈上和平之路的第一步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the first step towards the path to peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.17,0:34:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先是一系列微创注射{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We begin with a series of micro injections, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.50,0:34:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,将血清注入肌肉群{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the subjects major muscles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.55,0:34:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,血清注入后会引发细胞的急速改变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The serum infusion will cause immediate cellular change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.76,0:34:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后会刺激生长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then to stimulate growth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.89,0:34:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着会通过生命射线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The subject will be saturated, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.10,0:34:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,渗透主体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with Vita rays{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.23,0:34:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉还行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't so bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.90,0:34:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是青霉素{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was penicillin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.57,0:34:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,注射血清{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Serum infusion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.03,0:34:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒计时五秒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beginning in, five…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.62,0:34:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,四{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.08,0:34:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,三{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.29,0:34:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,二{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.08,0:34:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.01,0:35:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始吧 史塔克先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Mr. Stark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.62,0:35:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂文{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.41,0:35:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,能听到我说话吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.12,0:35:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在想去厕所是不是有点晚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably too late to go to the bathroom, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.38,0:35:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will proceed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.77,0:35:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,百分之十{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's ten percent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.98,0:35:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,百分之二十{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty percent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.36,0:35:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,三十{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.07,0:35:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,百分之四十{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's forty percent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.69,0:36:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,各项指标正常{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All signs are normal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.07,0:36:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,百分之五十{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's fifty percent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.91,0:36:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,六十{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sixty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.28,0:36:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,七十{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seventy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.21,0:36:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂文{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steven, Steven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.88,0:36:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快关掉 - 史蒂文{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut it down! - Steven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.13,0:36:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,快关掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.00,0:36:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,往回转 史塔克先生 关掉 往回转{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn back, Mr. Stark. Turn it off kill it, turn back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.34,0:36:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.51,0:36:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,别关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.97,0:36:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我扛得住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.39,0:36:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,八十 九十{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eighty…Ninety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.36,0:36:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,百分之百了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's one hundred percent!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.34,0:37:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,史塔克先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Stark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.44,0:37:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这小子还真成功了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.49,0:37:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我做到了 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I did it, - Yes, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.57,0:37:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们成功了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.78,0:37:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的成功了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You actually did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.75,0:37:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you feel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.25,0:37:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,长高了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taller.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.71,0:37:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来是高了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look taller.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.47,0:37:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,下去看看吧 议员先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we look now, Senator?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.43,0:37:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下柏林那帮家伙该紧张了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess the folks in Berlin are about to get very nervous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.68,0:37:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝贺你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.23,0:37:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.86,0:38:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,拦住他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.49,0:38:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们来了 快走 - 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're coming, come on. - Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.35,0:39:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right? Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.02,0:39:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他中枪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy's been shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.03,0:39:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我瞄准他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.99,0:39:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.51,0:39:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.17,0:41:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 宝贝儿 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, darling no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.88,0:41:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 - 不要 别伤害他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mommy. - No. Don't hurt him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.05,0:41:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.43,0:41:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.52,0:41:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,别伤害他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't hurt him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.69,0:41:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.69,0:41:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.45,0:41:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.29,0:41:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,去抓他 我会游泳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get him, I can swim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.67,0:42:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.88,0:42:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,先行军而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first of many.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.22,0:42:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,砍掉一个头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got off one head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.60,0:42:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,还会长出两个新的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two more shall take its place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.23,0:42:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,海德拉万岁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heil Hydra.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.54,0:43:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,元首可不喜欢被无视 施密特先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Fürer is not accustomed to being ignored, Herr Schmidt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.21,0:43:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你承诺为他提供武器 他才资助你的研究{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He funds your research because you promised him weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.09,0:43:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得听从他的命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You serve at his pleasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.09,0:43:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你负伤 他才将这个研究所给你作为奖励{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gave you this facility as a reward for your injuries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.30,0:43:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,奖励 这算什么奖励 这是流放{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reward, call it what it is, exile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.55,0:43:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不再符合他心目中雅利安人的完美形象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I no longer effect his image of Aryan perfection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.47,0:43:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得这只是外表的问题吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think this is about appearances?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.89,0:43:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的海德拉部门让人失望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Hydra division has failed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.68,0:43:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一年来提供的武器比步枪强不了多少{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to deliver so much as a rifle in over a year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.31,0:43:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我们从当地情报部门获知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we have learned through local intelligence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.69,0:43:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还在策划全面入侵挪威{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have mounted a full scaled incursion into Norway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.03,0:43:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,元首他担心 他怎么说的来着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Fürer fears, how does he put it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.19,0:43:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能再继续放纵红骷髅了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Red Skull has been indulged long enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.50,0:43:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.25,0:44:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们来看看我们的研究成果吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have come to see the results of our work, hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.22,0:44:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你们展示一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me show you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.30,0:44:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,希特勒口口声声说德意志千秋万代{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hitler speaks of a thousand year Reich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.35,0:44:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上却拿不出军队一个月的给养{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he cannot feed his armies for a month is truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.06,0:44:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的部队在欧洲战场上流血牺牲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His troops spill their blood across every field in Europe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.44,0:44:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他的目标却还是遥遥无期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But still he is no closer to achieving his goals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.82,0:44:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说你想用魔法来打赢战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I suppose you still aim to win this war through magic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.78,0:44:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是科学 但我理解你的困惑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Science, but I understand your confusion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.03,0:44:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,强大的力量总是令愚昧之人感到迷惑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great power has always baffled primitive men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.16,0:44:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,海德拉正在组建一支军队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hydra is assembling an arsenal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.00,0:44:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,能将我的敌人一网打尽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that will destroy my enemies in one stroke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.62,0:44:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管他们是谁 拥有多少兵力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wherever they are, regardless of how many forces they possess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.79,0:44:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需几个小时就能搞定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All in a matter of hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.34,0:44:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的敌人吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your enemies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.67,0:44:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的武器具有足够破坏力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My weapons contain enough destructive power, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.34,0:44:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,能摧毁世界上所有敌国的首都{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to decimate every hostile capital on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.68,0:44:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻而易举 先生们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite simply, gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.10,0:44:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已从诸神那里获得神力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have harnessed the power of the gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.77,0:44:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 施密特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Schmidt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.11,0:44:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.36,0:45:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们明白你有多疯狂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For making it clear how obviously mad you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.65,0:45:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,柏林也在地图上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Berlin is on this map!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.82,0:45:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.53,0:45:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要为你的傲慢付出代价{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be punished for your insolence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.08,0:45:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要被带到元首面前…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be brought before the Fürer and …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.76,0:45:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉了 博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My apologies, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.01,0:45:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们都知道 在希特勒的阴影下 海德拉无法壮大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we both knew Hydra could grow no further in Hitler's shadow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.44,0:45:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,海德拉万岁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heil Hydra.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.19,0:45:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,海德拉万岁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heil Hydra!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.45,0:45:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,海德拉万岁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heil Hydra.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.75,0:45:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think you got enough?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.05,0:46:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新制造血清的方法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any hope of reproducing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.37,0:46:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁进了你的基因序列{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the program is locked in your genetic code{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.80,0:46:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有厄斯金博士 这得花上好多年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But without Erskine it would take years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.64,0:46:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不该就这么死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He deserved more than this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.85,0:46:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算只成功了这么一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it could work only once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.56,0:46:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也会以你为傲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd be proud of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.23,0:46:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲利普斯上校 委员会需要答复{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel Phillips, my committee is demanding answers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.48,0:46:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 那你先说说怎么有个德国间谍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great, why don't we start with how a German spy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.90,0:46:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐在你车上混进了我的秘密基地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Got a ride to my secret installation in your car?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.61,0:46:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we got here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.99,0:46:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我是本国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speaking modestly I'm the{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.17,0:46:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好的机械工程师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}best mechanical engineer in this country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.33,0:46:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我也搞不清这东西的构造{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't know what's inside this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.25,0:46:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有它如何运转{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or how it works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.45,0:46:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们连这项技术的皮毛都没摸清{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not even close to this technology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.25,0:46:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那谁清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then who is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.25,0:46:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,海德拉 你应该看过我们的简报了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hydra, I'm sure you've been reading our briefings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.25,0:46:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有很多事要忙 上校{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on a number of committees, Colonel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.55,0:46:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,海德拉是纳粹的秘密科研部门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hydra is a Nazi Deep science division.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.84,0:46:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,由约翰·施密特领导{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's led by Johann Schmidt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.38,0:46:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过他有更大的野心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he has much bigger ambitions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.34,0:46:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,海德拉其实是个邪教组织{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hydra's practically a cult, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.62,0:46:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把施密特奉为神 认为他无所不能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they worship Schmidt, they think he's invincible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.93,0:46:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你打算怎么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what are you going to do about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.06,0:46:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天早上我和总统通过话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spoke to the President this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.73,0:46:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,从今天起 战略科学部门有了新任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As of today, the S.S.R. is being retasked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.40,0:47:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上校 - 我们要和海德拉决一死战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Colonel? - We are taking the fight to Hydra.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.56,0:47:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,收拾行李 卡特特工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pack your bags, Agent Carter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.40,0:47:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是 史塔克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too, Stark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.98,0:47:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今晚就飞往伦敦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're flying to London tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.74,0:47:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.78,0:47:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们要对付施密特 我也要加入{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're going after Schmidt, I want in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.53,0:47:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个实验品 你得去阿拉莫多（美国城市）{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your an experiment, you're going to Alamogordo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.95,0:47:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,血清起作用了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The serum worked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.08,0:47:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要的是一支军队 结果却只有你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked for an army, and all I got was you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.37,0:47:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.00,0:47:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,还远远不够{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.38,0:47:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我对上校有意见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all due respect to the Colonel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.13,0:47:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们没看到重点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we may be missing the point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.30,0:47:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了你的能力 史蒂夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen you in action, Steve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.47,0:47:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,更重要的是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}More importantly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.93,0:47:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个国家都看到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The countries seen it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.18,0:47:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿报纸来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.14,0:47:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从你的事迹登报后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The enlistment lines have been{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.40,0:47:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,大街上排满了想入伍的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}around the block since your picture hit the news stands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.43,0:47:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可不能让一个偶像级人物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't take a soldier, a symbol like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.10,0:47:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,藏在实验室里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And hide him in a Lab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.06,0:47:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.73,0:47:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在最重要的战场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to serve your country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.11,0:47:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,为国家效力吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the most important battlefield of the war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.41,0:47:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.57,0:47:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我求之不得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all I want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.12,0:47:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那恭喜你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then congratulations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.20,0:47:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你升官了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just got promoted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.58,0:48:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我行不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if I can do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.87,0:48:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这没什么大不了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.00,0:48:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,推销国库券 用来买子弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sell a few bonds, bonds buy's bullets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.00,0:48:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,再用子弹打纳粹 砰砰砰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullets kill Nazi's, bing, bang, boom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.92,0:48:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是美国英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an American hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.84,0:48:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是觉得这我想的不一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just I don't think I'm getting there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.51,0:48:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,参议员他很有势力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The senator's got a lot of pull up on the hill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.76,0:48:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我们一起好好干{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You play ball, with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.05,0:48:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快就能领导自己的队伍了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be leading your own platoon in no time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.26,0:48:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.02,0:48:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,上吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.90,0:48:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁既强壮又勇敢 拯救美国于水火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's strong and brave, here to save the American way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.19,0:48:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是所有人都能掀起狂澜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all of us can storm a beach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.07,0:48:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,开动坦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or drive a tank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.24,0:48:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们仍然可以战斗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's still a way all of us can fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.24,0:48:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁愿意与他一样 加入我们的战斗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who loves to fight like the man for what right by day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.87,0:48:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,E系列国防债券{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Series E Defense bonds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.83,0:48:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你每买一张战士们就会多一颗子弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each one you buy is a bullet in the barrel of your best guys gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.37,0:48:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁为美国走遍挨家挨户{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who built and came door to door for America?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.04,0:48:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,扛着大旗插遍海岸线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carries the flag shore to shore for America.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.46,0:48:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,从霍博肯到斯波坎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From Hoboken to Spokane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.59,0:48:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,胸前顶着闪烁的星星 胸怀计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Star Spangled Man, with the plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.02,0:49:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,停{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.27,0:49:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 别看镜头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, don't look at the camera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.94,0:49:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能忘记 还存在巨大威胁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't ignore there's a threat and the warning is big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.36,0:49:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你每买一张战士们就会多一颗子弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each one you buy is a bullet in the barrel of your best guys gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.90,0:49:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会去柏林吊死纳粹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who'll hang the noose on the goose that we loosed from Berlin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.99,0:49:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会听到美国的呼唤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who will redeem heed the call for America.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.16,0:49:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁买谁就为美国做了贡献{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who buys it all, gives his all for America.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.38,0:49:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会坚持完成这个任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who stands to prove that task.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.13,0:49:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,胸前顶着闪烁的星星 胸怀计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Star Spangled Man, with the plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.59,0:49:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都是为了赢得战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all know it's about trying to win the war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.76,0:49:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有子弹和绷带我们赢不了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't do that without bullets and bandages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.85,0:49:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有坦克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tanks and casts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.10,0:49:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,该是你们出力的时候了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's where you come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.27,0:49:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你买一张国债就能保护你爱的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every bond you buy will help protect someone you love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.23,0:49:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 他在你后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out there, he's there behind you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.98,0:49:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,德国人就不敢招惹我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Germans will think twice about trying to get the drop on us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.57,0:49:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚强 坚定又真实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stalwart, and steady and true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.99,0:50:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他是怎么打败敌人的吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See how this guy can shoot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.36,0:50:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道没有候补人员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can tell that there's no substitute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.29,0:50:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很坚强并时刻准备好保护美国{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forceful and ready to defend the Red, White and Blue!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.13,0:50:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁将会打败轴心国 谁和狐狸一样聪明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who'll give the Axis the sack and is smart as a fox?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.88,0:50:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会像雄鹰一样高飞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Far as an eagle we'll soar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.76,0:50:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁让纳粹不敢踏出自己的地盘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's making Adolph afraid to step out of his bunk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.26,0:50:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道我们为何而战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows what we're fighting for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.14,0:50:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们唤醒了沉睡的巨人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who waked the giant that napped in America?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.98,0:50:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道 他就是美国队长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know it's no one but, Captain America.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.62,0:50:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁将完成我们的使命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who'll finish what they began?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.07,0:50:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁将把鬼子踢回日本{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who'll kick the krauts to Japan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.40,0:50:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,星光闪烁的男人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Star Spangled Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.32,0:50:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,胸怀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.83,0:50:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plaaaaaaaaaan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.42,0:50:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们准备好和我一起去修理希特勒了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many of you are ready to help me sock ol' Adolph on the jaw?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.22,0:51:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.69,0:51:07.69,Note,0,0,0,0,,（1943年11月 意大利 距前线五英里处）
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.69,0:51:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,有志愿者吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a volunteer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.23,0:51:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不志愿的话我们在这干嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We already volunteered, how do you think I got here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.98,0:51:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要看妹子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring back the girls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.99,0:51:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想她们只唱一首歌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think they only know the one song.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.36,0:51:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.03,0:51:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看看我能做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me…I'll see what I can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.16,0:51:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧 甜心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do that, sweetheart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.00,0:51:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的靴子不错 小仙女 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice boots, Tinkerbell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.71,0:51:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 伙计们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.83,0:51:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是一队的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all on the same team here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.59,0:51:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.79,0:51:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这签个名吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sign this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.90,0:51:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,别在意 他们会喜欢你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about it, they'll warm up to you. Don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.78,0:52:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 史蒂夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello Steve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.75,0:52:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.91,0:52:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我其实不该来这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officially I'm not here at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.71,0:52:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的表演不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was quite a performance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.96,0:52:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.05,0:52:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得即兴表演一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to improvise a little bit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.17,0:52:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前的观众通常都是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crowds I'm used to are usually are, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.22,0:52:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小孩 - 我知道你是美国的新希望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- twelve. - I understand you're America's new hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.39,0:52:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每到一个州国债销售额就上升百分之十{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond sales take a ten percent bump on every state I visit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.14,0:52:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来是布拉德参议员的主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Senator Brandt's idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.23,0:52:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少他还让我做这些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least he's got me doing this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.31,0:52:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲利普斯还想把我关在实验室里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phillips would have had me stuck in a lab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.36,0:52:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只有这两个选择吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And these are you only two options?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.90,0:52:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,实验室小白鼠或是跳舞的猴子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lab rat or a dancing monkey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.07,0:52:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道 你能做的远不止这些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were meant for more than this, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.58,0:52:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.83,0:52:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我长久以来的梦想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, for the longest time I dreamed about, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.46,0:52:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是去国外战场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…coming over seas and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.92,0:52:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,到最前线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Being on the front lines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.09,0:53:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我的国家效力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Serving my country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.42,0:53:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,等到我终于如愿以偿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally got everything I wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.93,0:53:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,却是穿着紧身衣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm wearing tights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.69,0:53:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们好像刚打了一场恶仗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look like they've been through hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.78,0:53:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些士兵最惨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These men move the most.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.91,0:53:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,施密特派出了一支部队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Schmidt sent out a force to a zone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.41,0:53:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,两百名士兵去迎战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}200 men went up against him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.74,0:53:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来的不到五十个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Less than 50 returned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.71,0:53:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的观众里就有107步兵团的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your audience contained what was left of the 107th.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.08,0:53:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人的不是被杀就是被俘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest were killed or captured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.21,0:53:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,107步兵团{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The 107th?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.26,0:53:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.59,0:53:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.05,0:53:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲利普斯上校{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel Phillips.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.93,0:53:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是胸前顶着星星藏着计划的男人嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if it isn't the Star Spangled Man with the plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.55,0:53:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天有什么计划呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your plan today?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.14,0:53:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要博尔扎诺战役的伤亡名单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need the causality list from Bolzano.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.68,0:53:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没资格命令我 小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't get to give me orders, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.10,0:53:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想知道107步兵团的詹姆斯·巴恩斯中士的情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need one name. Sergeant James Barnes from the 107th.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.52,0:53:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我之后再找你算账{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I are going to have a conversation later that you won't enjoy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.44,0:54:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你告诉我他还活着 B A R{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please tell me he's alive, sir. B-A-R…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.19,0:54:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道怎么拼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can spell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.36,0:54:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天签了很多哀悼信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've signed more of these{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.64,0:54:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,名字我都记不清了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}condolence letters today than I would care to count.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.16,0:54:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.16,0:54:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个名字我有印象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The name does sound familiar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.87,0:54:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.92,0:54:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那其他人呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the others?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.13,0:54:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们准备去营救吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you planning a rescue mission?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.92,0:54:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须以大局为重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's called winning the war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.63,0:54:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但既然你知道他们在哪 为什么…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you know where they are, why not…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.43,0:54:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在敌阵后方三十英里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're thirty miles behind the lines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.97,0:54:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,得穿过欧洲戒备最森严的地区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Through some of the most heavily fortified territory in Europe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.10,0:54:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,去营救只会损失更多人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd lose more men than we'd save.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.85,0:54:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不指望你能理解这些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't expect you to understand that, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.18,0:54:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你只是个跳舞的小丑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you're a chorus girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.44,0:54:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我能理解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I understand just fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.36,0:54:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那去其他地方理解吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well then understand it somewhere else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.32,0:54:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我没看错海报的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I read the posters correctly, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.48,0:54:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得在三十分钟内赶到其他地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've got someplace to be in thirty minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.24,0:54:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.20,0:54:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.33,0:54:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你有什么想说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you have something to say, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.41,0:55:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在最好别说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}right now is the perfect time to keep it to yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.42,0:55:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么计划 走去奥地利吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do plan to do, walk to Austria.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.63,0:55:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果可以的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that's what it takes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.97,0:55:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到上校说的了 你朋友可能已经死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard the Colonel, your friend is most likely dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.35,0:55:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不能确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.47,0:55:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便如此 制定计划需要时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even so, he's devising a strategy, it takes time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.06,0:55:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,等他计划好了就已经晚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the time he's done that, it could be too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.39,0:55:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.69,0:55:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过我能做的远不止这些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told me you thought I was meant for more than this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.86,0:55:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you mean that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.53,0:55:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,千真万确{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.74,0:55:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就让我去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you gotta let me go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.25,0:55:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能做的不止这点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do more than that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.75,0:55:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,上台了 姑娘们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On stage, girls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.05,0:55:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的头盔呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my helmet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.05,0:55:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人看到罗杰斯吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone seen Rogers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.97,0:55:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,海德拉军营在克劳斯堡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Hydra camp is in Krossberg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.93,0:55:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,在两座山脉之间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's up between these two mountain ranges.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.93,0:55:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像一个工厂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a factory of some kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.10,0:56:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会把你送到门口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should be able to drop you around the doorstep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.27,0:56:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽可能地接近目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get me as close as you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.98,0:56:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们着陆后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you two are going{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.87,0:56:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有很多麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be in a lot of trouble when you land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.23,0:56:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不也是 - 我要是遇到麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you won't. - Where I'm going if any anybody, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.03,0:56:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪打他们就行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…yells at me I can just shoot them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.61,0:56:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也会开枪打你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they will undoubtedly shoot back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.61,0:56:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就指望这玩意有用吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well lets hope this is good for something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.41,0:56:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特特工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Carter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.53,0:56:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不是那么赶时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're not in too much of a hurry I thought{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.91,0:56:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们过会可以去享受一下芝士火锅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we could stop off in Usurea for a late night Fondue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.58,0:56:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,史塔克是我见过最好的平民飞行员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stark is the best civilian pilot I've ever seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.50,0:56:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有他敢在这种气候起飞 有他在是我们走运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's mad enough to brave this air space. We're lucky to have him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.88,0:56:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们俩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you two?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.05,0:56:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真要去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.22,0:56:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,芝士火锅吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fondue?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.43,0:56:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是收发器 准备好就启动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your transponder, active it when you're ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.72,0:56:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会根据信号找到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the signal will lead us straight to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.14,0:56:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定这管用吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure this thing works?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.40,0:56:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,它测试的次数比你还多 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It tested more than you, pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.74,0:56:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来 我们要把你送到门口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back here, we're taking you all the way there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.16,0:56:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跳了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm jumping this plane, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.09,0:56:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们赶紧掉头离开这鬼地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}turn this thing around and get the hell out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.20,0:57:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能命令我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't give me orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.33,0:57:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.87,0:57:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是队长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.35,0:57:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如你所见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you can see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.69,0:57:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦尔基里正按计划在建造中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Production of Valkyrie is progressing on schedule.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.69,0:57:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使是这种大小的零件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even with components of this size.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.53,0:57:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,将进度提高百分之六十{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Increase the output by sixty percent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.44,0:57:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他研究所也一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And speak with our other facilities to do the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.70,0:57:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这些都是囚犯 我想他们没这力气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But these prisoners, I'm not sure they have the strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.25,0:57:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就用尽他们的力气 博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then use up what strength they have left, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.92,0:57:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,工人永远都不会缺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are always more workers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.92,0:57:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在别烦我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.48,0:58:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你 德国佬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Fritz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.02,0:58:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天 老子也会有根棍子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of these days I'm going to have a stick of my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.64,0:58:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fellas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.56,1:00:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you suppose to be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.81,1:00:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国队长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain America.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.35,1:00:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说啥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, beg your pardon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.32,1:01:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么着 所有人都走吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we taking, everybody?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.65,1:01:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来自夫勒斯诺 帅哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm from Fresno, ace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.45,1:01:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他人吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There anybody else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.53,1:01:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在找詹姆斯·巴恩斯中士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for a Sergeant James Barnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.37,1:01:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,工厂里有个隔离病房{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an isolation ward in the factory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.12,1:01:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,被带去那的人都没回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's ever come back from it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.29,1:01:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.66,1:01:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,林木线在西北方 离大门八十码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tree line is northwest, it's eighty yards past the gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.04,1:01:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们出去 给他们点颜色看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out fast, and give them hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.96,1:01:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到其他人后和你们会合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll meet you guys in the clearing with anybody else I find.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.13,1:01:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你知道你在做什么吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. You know what you're doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.21,1:01:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我揍了阿道夫·希特勒两百多次了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I knocked out Adolph Hitler over 200 times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.07,1:01:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道怎么用吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how to use that thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.66,1:01:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.67,1:01:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.51,1:02:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这货可不是别克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly a Buick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.64,1:02:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是点火器 - 啥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's Zündung. - Zündung?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.31,1:02:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,快启动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get going, Dum Dum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.89,1:02:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你还会说德语{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know you spoke German.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.98,1:02:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近在勒阿弗尔学的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I recently mastered at Le Havre.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.54,1:02:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便 法国妞正点多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus the French girls much cuter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.15,1:02:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还用说吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the resume.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.85,1:02:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你在干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, what are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.18,1:02:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的士兵不是对手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our forces are out matched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.04,1:03:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.04,1:03:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿手榴弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab a grenade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.21,1:04:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,鹿仔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.68,1:04:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.81,1:04:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 史蒂夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me, it's Steve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.81,1:04:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.81,1:04:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来 - 史蒂夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Steve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.15,1:04:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.11,1:04:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你更矮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were smaller?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.70,1:04:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.16,1:04:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.33,1:04:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我加入了军队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I joined the army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.13,1:04:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,痛吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did it hurt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.22,1:04:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.88,1:04:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 会一直痛吗 - 目前为止还在痛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Permanent? - So far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.25,1:05:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国队长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain America.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.75,1:05:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真激动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How exciting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.30,1:05:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是你的粉丝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a great fan of your films.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.09,1:05:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说厄斯金博士还是成功了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Doctor Erskine managed it after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.39,1:05:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然没什么进步 但是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly an improvement, but, still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.52,1:05:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是很不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impressive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.35,1:05:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你等着瞧吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got no idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.94,1:05:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.88,1:06:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管厄斯金对你说了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what lies Erskine told you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.92,1:06:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才是他最成功的成果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see I was his greatest success.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.81,1:06:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有变成这鬼模样吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have one of those, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.61,1:06:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被骗了 队长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are deluded, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.28,1:06:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你假装自己是个普通士兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pretend to be a simple soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.28,1:06:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你却不敢承认现实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in reality you are just afraid to admit, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.28,1:06:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都已经不是人类了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that we have left humanity behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.41,1:06:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我们这种人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.79,1:06:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该对自己的力量感到自豪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They embrace it proudly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.37,1:06:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所畏惧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.83,1:06:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么要跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then how come you're running?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.85,1:07:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.31,1:07:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 我们去楼顶吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, we go to the roof?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.02,1:07:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我怎么办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.53,1:07:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那飞机只能坐一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where will I sit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.07,1:07:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别划花我的车 博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a scratch, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.70,1:07:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a scratch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.11,1:07:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 我们一个个过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. One at a time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.10,1:08:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿肯定有绳子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta get a rope or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.35,1:08:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 快离开这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go, get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.14,1:08:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会丢下你一个人走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not without you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.12,1:08:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,布兰德议员 很遗憾地告知您{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senator brandt, I regret to inform you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.46,1:08:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂文 G。罗杰斯队长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Stephen G. Rogers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.88,1:08:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在敌后第三区域失踪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}went missing behind enemy lines, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.30,1:09:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,侦察队搜索过后也没有结果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the third area. Reconnaissance has proven unfruitful as a result, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.97,1:09:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能宣布罗杰斯队长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I must declare Captain Rogers, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.35,1:09:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,在行动中阵亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…killed in action. Period.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.65,1:09:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一架侦察机回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last surveillance flight is back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.77,1:09:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有生命迹象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sign of activity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.78,1:09:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,去喝杯咖啡吧 下士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get a cup of coffee, corporal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.41,1:09:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能拿史塔克怎么样 他是富豪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't touch Stark, he's rich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.49,1:09:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是军队最大的武器赞助商{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's the army's number one weapons contractor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.87,1:09:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而你什么也不是 - 恕我直言 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You are neither one. - With respect, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.50,1:09:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不后悔我的行为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't regret my actions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.21,1:09:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为罗杰斯队长也不后悔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't think Captain Rogers did, either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.29,1:09:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我在意你的想法吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you think I give a damn about your opinions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.05,1:09:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给过你机会 卡特特工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took a chance with you, Agent Carter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.76,1:09:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在美国的黄金男孩死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now America's golden boy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.15,1:09:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有很多优秀的士兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a lot of other good men are dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.68,1:09:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为你喜欢人家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause you had a crush.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.93,1:09:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.05,1:09:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是有信念{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had faith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.51,1:09:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那等到这个部门被关闭的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well I hope that's a big comfort to you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.64,1:09:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你的信念能给你点安慰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…when they shut this division down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.43,1:09:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们回来了 真不敢相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There they are, I can't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.60,1:09:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边在搞什么飞机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's going on out there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.72,1:11:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有些人需要医治{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of these men need medical attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.64,1:11:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生 我受伤了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medic, I got wounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.06,1:11:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意接受处分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to surrender myself for disciplinary action.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.06,1:11:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没这必要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That won't be necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.65,1:11:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.44,1:11:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,信念哈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faith, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.16,1:11:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你迟到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.79,1:11:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玩意坏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't call my ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.13,1:11:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,为美国队长欢呼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hear it for, Captain America.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.73,1:12:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我荣幸地在此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am honored to present, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.52,1:12:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,将这个英勇奖章{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…this medal for valor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.23,1:12:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,颁给我的好朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To my personal friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.70,1:12:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国队长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain America.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.66,1:12:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国队长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain America?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.70,1:12:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长 该你出场了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, that's your cue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.62,1:12:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为他更高点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought he'd be taller.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.14,1:12:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个在波兰和波罗的海{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one here in Poland, and the Baltic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.85,1:12:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,第六个在…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the sixth one was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.48,1:12:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}about…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.94,1:12:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这 离边境三四十英里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…here. 30, 40 miles west of the maginal line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.03,1:12:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只大概看了一眼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got a quick look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.74,1:12:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人能做到十全十美{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well nobody's perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.91,1:12:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是我们已知的武器工厂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are the weapon factories we know about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.91,1:12:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,据巴恩斯中士说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sergeant Barnes said that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.07,1:13:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,海德拉把所有装备都运到了另一个地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hydra shipped all the parts to another facility, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.29,1:13:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,而在地图上没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that isn't on this map.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.46,1:13:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特特工在和军情六处协商{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Carter co-ordinate with MI6.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.08,1:13:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要每个同盟国都去找海德拉总部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want every allied eyeball looking for that main Hydra base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.05,1:13:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.05,1:13:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去给约翰·施密特一个下马威{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are going to set a fire under Johann Schmidt's ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.84,1:13:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样 罗杰斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do say, Rogers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.34,1:13:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你背出了地图 你觉得你能搞定海德拉吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your map. You think you can wipe Hydra off of it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.89,1:13:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.18,1:13:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一支队伍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll need a team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.18,1:13:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经有了最出色的士兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're already putting together the best men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.35,1:13:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我直言 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all due respect, Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.31,1:13:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So am I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.85,1:13:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们直话直说吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's get this straight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.19,1:13:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们好不容易逃出来 你又想让我们去吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We barely got out of there alive, and you want us to go back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.90,1:13:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.19,1:13:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,貌似听起来很有趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds rather, fun actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.03,1:13:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我加入{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.92,1:13:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也加入{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.09,1:13:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,日啊我也去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I'll always play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.72,1:13:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你得为我做一件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you gotta do one thing for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.63,1:13:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.60,1:13:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,请客喝酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open a tab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.60,1:14:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这容易{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well that was easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.06,1:14:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一轮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another round.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.06,1:14:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们怎么喝得下这么多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they putting all this stuff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.36,1:14:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧 告诉过你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, told you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.57,1:14:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are all idiots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.24,1:14:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.49,1:14:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备跟随美国队长去赴汤蹈火吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready to follow Captain America into the jowls of death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.66,1:14:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.04,1:14:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个和我一样从布鲁克林来的小个子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That little guy from Brooklyn. I was too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.46,1:14:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,打起架来从不放弃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't like to run away from a fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.71,1:14:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得看着他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm following him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.01,1:14:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还穿紧身衣吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you keeping your outfit, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.89,1:14:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.93,1:14:38.53,Note,0,0,0,0,,（巡演取消）
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.14,1:14:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还真习惯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kinda growing on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.27,1:14:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好哥们要记住 天下没有不散的宴席{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And remember that the best of friends must part, must part{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.44,1:14:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 再见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adieu, adieu…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.98,1:14:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 队长 - 卡特特工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Captain. - Agent Carter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.20,1:14:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.20,1:14:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍华德为你准备了些新装备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howard has some equipment for you to try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.03,1:15:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明早去看看 - 听起来不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tomorrow morning. - Sounds good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.04,1:15:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你的精英部队已经准备好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see your top squad is prepping for duty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.46,1:15:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不喜欢音乐吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't like music?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.79,1:15:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.71,1:15:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没准等战争结束{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might even, when this is all over, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.88,1:15:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还会去跳个舞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…go dancing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.97,1:15:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们还等什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what are we waiting for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.85,1:15:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,合适的舞伴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The right partner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.72,1:15:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住明天 队长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pay attention, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.02,1:15:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 女士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Ma'am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.23,1:15:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.81,1:15:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我小透明了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm invisible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.65,1:15:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下换成我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm turning into you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.44,1:15:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉真不好受{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a horrible dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.32,1:15:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别想太多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't take it so hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.78,1:15:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许她还有个闺蜜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe she's got a friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.32,1:15:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,初始特征不同寻常{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Initial signature is unusual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.16,1:15:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,初始阶段一直是中性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alpha beta remain neutral.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.50,1:15:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,难怪罗杰斯能承受住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No doubt Rogers picked up on that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.67,1:15:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去倒是挺无害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems harmless enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.46,1:15:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不像有什么值得担心的样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hard to see what all the fuss is about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.01,1:16:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这记下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Write that down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.31,1:16:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下 我找史塔克先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. I'm looking for a Mr. Stark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.02,1:16:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟菲利普斯上校在里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in with Colonel Phillips.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.07,1:16:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,想等的话当然也欢迎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, of course you're welcome to wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.62,1:16:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I uh, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.95,1:16:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,在报上看到你的所作所为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Read about what you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.66,1:16:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那事儿…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that…yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.25,1:16:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那件事…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well that's, you know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.25,1:16:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,略尽绵力而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just doing what needed to be done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.88,1:16:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,说话还真谦虚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounded like more than that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.38,1:16:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你差不多救了四百人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved nearly 400 men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.26,1:16:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 没什么大不了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, it's not a big deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.27,1:16:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,对他们的老婆来说可不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell that to their wives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.56,1:16:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得不是所有人都结婚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I don't think they were all married.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.36,1:16:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.11,1:16:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个嘛…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that…you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.23,1:16:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,取决于你怎么定义…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tha…That depends on the definition of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.90,1:17:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,而美国的女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Women of America.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.28,1:17:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,都欠你的情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They owe you their thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.28,1:17:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,而既然她们不在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And um, seeing as they're not here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.00,1:17:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.00,1:17:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都在等你 没事要忙的话就快来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're ready for you. If you're not otherwise occupied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.01,1:17:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡特特工 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Carter, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.26,1:17:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来找个伴也没什么难{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like finding a partner wasn't that hard after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.76,1:17:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你想的那样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, that's not what you thought it was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.43,1:17:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都没想 队长 完全没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think anything, Captain. Not one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.52,1:17:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直想成为军人 如今得偿所愿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always wanted to be a soldier, and now you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.43,1:17:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,就跟其他人没什么两样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like all the rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.31,1:17:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你跟史塔克又算什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well what about you and Stark?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.48,1:17:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么知道你们有没有…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I know you two haven't been…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.11,1:17:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吃什么芝士火锅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…fondueing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.99,1:17:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是一丁点儿都不懂女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still don't know a bloody thing about women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.87,1:17:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,芝士火锅只是奶酪和面包 哥们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fondue's just cheese and bread, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.91,1:17:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.91,1:17:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.47,1:17:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你该动动脑子 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or should you, pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.66,1:17:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候你自以为你摸透女人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The moment you think you know what's going on in…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.29,1:17:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果发现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a woman's head. Is the{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.22,1:17:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本就不是那么回事儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}moment your goose is well and truly cooked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.25,1:17:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我嘛 更注重工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, I concentrate on work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.84,1:17:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,就现在来说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which at the moment, is about{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.27,1:17:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是保证你和你的人都不送命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}making sure you and your men do not get killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.05,1:18:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,材质是碳的聚合物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carbon polymer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.34,1:18:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该可以承受德国军刺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should withstand your average German bayonet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.05,1:18:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但海德拉可不会用小刀对付你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although, Hydra's not going to attack you with a pocket knife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.76,1:18:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说你有些装备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear you're uh, kinda attached.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.64,1:18:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,用起来很顺手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's handier than you might think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.27,1:18:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,有几个选项供你选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took the liberty of coming up with some options.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.31,1:18:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个很有趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one's fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.86,1:18:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面装了继电器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's being fitted with electrical relays.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.03,1:18:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能让你… - 那这个呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That will allow you to… - What about this one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.44,1:18:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 那件还未完工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no that's just a prototype.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.44,1:18:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么材质{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it made of?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.74,1:18:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸音金属{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vibranium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.32,1:18:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,比钢更强 重量则只有其三分之一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's stronger than steel, and a third of the weight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.78,1:18:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,它可以使攻击无效化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's completely vibration absorbent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.41,1:18:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何不作为全军配备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come it's not standard issue?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.96,1:18:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种材料在地球上实为罕见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the rarest metal on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.63,1:18:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你手中这一件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you're holding there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.71,1:18:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是绝无仅有的孤品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all we got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.75,1:18:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快好了吗 史塔克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you quite finished, Mr. Stark?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.55,1:18:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确信队长还有些未完的任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure the Captain has some unfinished business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.80,1:18:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得如何{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.23,1:18:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 能派上用场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I think it works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.70,1:19:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,对服装我还有些想法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had some ideas about the uniform.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.03,1:19:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,听你的 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you want, pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.03,1:21:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直在失败{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are failing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.33,1:21:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们征服这个星球的计划就要成功了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are close to an offensive that will shake the planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.08,1:21:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在却一推再推 就因为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we are continually delayed because, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.13,1:21:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你搞不定一个带盾牌的白痴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you cannot outwit a simpleton with a shield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.79,1:21:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我的专长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hardly my area of expertise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.71,1:21:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只会发明武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, I merely develop weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.34,1:21:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又不会用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…I…I cannot fire them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.59,1:21:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,完成你的使命 博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finish your mission, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.23,1:21:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,别在那之前就被美国佬给搞死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before the American finishes his.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.81,1:21:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.93,1:21:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 施密特长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Herr Schmidt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.69,1:21:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们全军覆灭了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We fought to the last man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.73,1:21:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然还没有全灭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evidently not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.21,1:22:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得在科尼岛我逼你玩旋风飞车吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember when I made you ride the Cyclone on Coney Island?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.17,1:22:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得 我吐了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and I threw up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.92,1:22:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不会是报复吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't pay back, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.59,1:22:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.55,1:22:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的 佐拉博士在火车上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right, Doctor Zola is on the train.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.39,1:22:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,海德拉的人让他打开节流阀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hydra dispatcher gave him permission to open up the throttle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.01,1:22:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管他去哪 他们肯定很需要他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wherever he's going, they must need him bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.15,1:22:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们快得像要去投胎 我们要快行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get going because they're moving like the devil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.28,1:22:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只有十秒钟空隙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We only got about a ten second window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.94,1:22:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,错过了那个间隙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You miss that, window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.45,1:22:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,就要被火车撞死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're bugs on a windshield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.86,1:22:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心脚下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind the gap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.12,1:22:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备上了 兄弟们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta get moving, buds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.14,1:23:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,拖住他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.14,1:23:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.99,1:24:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就要打败他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had him on the ropes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.24,1:24:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.83,1:24:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.37,1:24:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.25,1:24:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,快杀了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.38,1:24:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,鹿仔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bucky!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.47,1:25:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.60,1:25:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住我的手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab my hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.43,1:25:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.04,1:26:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.80,1:26:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.84,1:26:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,牛排{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.13,1:26:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is in it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.14,1:26:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,牛肉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.64,1:26:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 你知不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor, do you realize, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.23,1:26:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,…这么一块高级牛肉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…how difficult it is to get a hold, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.40,1:26:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,…在这可是很难搞到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of a prime cut like that out here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.90,1:26:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不吃肉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't eat meat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.36,1:26:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么不吃 - 不合口味{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why not? - It disagrees with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.36,1:26:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,氰化物怎么样 也让你肚子不舒服吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about Cyanide, does that give you the rumbly tummy too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.29,1:26:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次我们想活捉海德拉的特工{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every Hydra agent that we've tried to take alive, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.91,1:26:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,…都在我们能阻止前服毒自尽了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…consumed a little pill before we can stop them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.00,1:26:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.09,1:27:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以聪明过人的我推论{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, here's my brilliant theory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.38,1:27:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.89,1:27:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在威胁我 上校{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're trying to intimidate me, Colonel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.72,1:27:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你带了晚餐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought you dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.81,1:27:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,由于他所提供的宝贵信息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Given the valuable information that he has provided, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.48,1:27:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及作为他大力合作的交换条件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in exchange for his full co-operation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.53,1:27:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐拉博士将被送返瑞士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor Zola is being remanded to Switzerland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.53,1:27:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,今早我把消息发去了华盛顿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sent that message to Washington this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.16,1:27:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是被加密了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course it was encoded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.95,1:27:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的人还没解开吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys haven't broken those codes, have you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.45,1:27:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然可就尴尬了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be awkward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.87,1:27:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,施密特不会相信的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Schmidt will know this is a lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.83,1:27:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样他都会杀了你 博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going to kill you anyway, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.71,1:27:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你成了他的障碍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a liability.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.75,1:27:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他最多的秘密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know more about Schmidt than anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.96,1:27:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.76,1:27:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一个被你害死的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the last guy you cost us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.11,1:27:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是罗杰斯队长最好的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was Captain Rogers closest friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.26,1:27:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我可不敢打包票你会有什么下场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I wouldn't count on the very best of protection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.14,1:27:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,自保{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.31,1:27:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,…还是保施密特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or Schmidt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.43,1:27:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己选吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just the hand you've been dealt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.73,1:28:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,施密特坚信他是在追随众神的脚步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Schmidt believes he walks in the footsteps of the gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.78,1:28:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有得到整个世界他才会满足{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the world itself will satisfy him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.16,1:28:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道他疯了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do realize that's nuts, don't you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.20,1:28:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.91,1:28:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯不疯狂已经不重要了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sanity of the plan is of no consequence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.37,1:28:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么 - 因为他做得到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And why is that? - Because he can do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.33,1:28:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的目标是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's his target?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.83,1:28:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His target, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.46,1:28:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是整个世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.57,1:28:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.86,1:28:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,海德拉将会称霸世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hydra will stand master of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.12,1:28:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,在瓦尔基里女神的庇佑下赢得胜利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Born to victory on the wings of the Valkyrie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.79,1:28:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人的武器对我们都不堪一击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our enemies weapons will be powerless against us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.21,1:29:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是一架飞机被击落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they shoot down one plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.29,1:29:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有数百架飞机会予以猛烈回击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hundreds more will rain fire upon them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.72,1:29:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,砍掉一个头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they cut off one head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.51,1:29:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,还会长出两个新的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two more shall take its place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.26,1:29:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,海德拉万岁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heil Hydra.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.43,1:29:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,海德拉万岁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heil Hydra!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.93,1:29:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,海德拉万岁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heil Hydra!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.52,1:29:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,海德拉万岁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heil Hydra…Heil Hydra!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.61,1:29:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,海德拉万岁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heil Hydra, Heil Hydra!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.44,1:29:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,海德拉万岁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heil Hydra.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.01,1:29:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,厄斯金博士说过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor Erskine said that, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.31,1:30:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,…血清不光会影响肌肉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the serum wouldn't just affect my muscles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.81,1:30:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,也会影响细胞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would affect my cells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.02,1:30:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,产生一个再生和愈合的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Create a protective system, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.23,1:30:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,…保护系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Of regeneration and healing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.07,1:30:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means, um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.70,1:30:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会醉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get drunk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.20,1:30:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.87,1:30:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的新陈代谢速率是常人的四倍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your metabolism burns four times faster than the average person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.96,1:30:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士觉得那可能是副作用之一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thought it could be one of the side effects.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.38,1:30:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是你的错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't your fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.72,1:30:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看了报告吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you read the report?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.09,1:30:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,看了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.10,1:30:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你该知道是我害死了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then you know that's not true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.01,1:30:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你尽力了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did everything you could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.02,1:30:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信你朋友吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you believe in your friend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.44,1:30:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你尊重他吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you respect him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.40,1:30:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就别再自责{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then stop blaming yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.53,1:30:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样才不会有损他的尊严{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that was the dignity of his choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.95,1:30:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定认为值得为你赴汤蹈火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He damn well must have thought you were worth it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.53,1:30:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了施密特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going after Schmidt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.49,1:31:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要海德拉还没被赶尽杀绝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going to stop{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.35,1:31:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就不会停手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'til all of Hydra is dead, or captured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.96,1:31:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't be alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.05,1:31:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰·施密特该被扔进疯人院{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johann Schmidt belongs in a bug house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.30,1:31:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他觉得自己是神{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thinks he's a god and he's{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.51,1:31:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要炸掉半个世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}willing to blow up half the world to prove it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.43,1:31:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就从美国开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starting with the U.S.A.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.18,1:31:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,施密特的力量超出我们的能力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Schmidt's working with powers beyond our capabilities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.10,1:31:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只要穿过大西洋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gets across the Atlantic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.97,1:31:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能在一小时内抹平整个东海岸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll wipe out the entire eastern seaboard in an hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.15,1:31:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有多少时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much time we got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.27,1:31:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,据那位新朋友的说法 不到24小时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to my new best friend, in twenty four hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.24,1:31:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在人在哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.28,1:31:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,海德拉最后的基地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hydra's last base is here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.78,1:31:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在阿尔卑斯山脉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the Alps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.91,1:31:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,地表下五百英尺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}500 feet below the surface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.33,1:31:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们该怎么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what are we suppose to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.08,1:31:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,又不能直接敲门进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like we can just knock on the front door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.96,1:31:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么不能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.38,1:31:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's exactly what we're going to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.22,1:34:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,自大也许不是美国人的独有特征{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arrogance may not be a uniquely American trait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.55,1:34:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不得不说你诠释的比别人都出色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I must say you do it better than anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.60,1:34:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而即便是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, there are limits, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.26,1:34:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,也有做不到的事 队长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to what even you can do, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.36,1:34:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是厄斯金的说法不同{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or did Erskine tell you otherwise?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.78,1:34:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟我说你疯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me you were insane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.82,1:34:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他嫉妒我天赋异禀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He resented my genius, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.87,1:34:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,还想否认本就属于我的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tried to deny me what was rightfully mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.33,1:34:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他却给了你一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he gave you everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.54,1:34:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.67,1:34:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么特别之处吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What made you so special?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.26,1:34:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.68,1:34:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是个布鲁克林的小个子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just a kid from Brooklyn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.73,1:35:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以和你耗一整天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do this all day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.49,1:35:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然可以 当然了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh of course you can, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.70,1:35:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但可惜的是我有点忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But unfortunately I am on a tight schedule.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.87,1:35:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So am I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.47,1:35:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗杰斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rogers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.18,1:35:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能用得上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might need this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.56,1:35:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.11,1:35:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们进去了 立即进攻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in, assaulting now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.61,1:35:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.46,1:36:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,砍掉一个头 还会长出两个…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got off one head, two more…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.75,1:36:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就把这两个也砍掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go find two more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.65,1:37:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,停火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cease fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.45,1:37:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你迟到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.20,1:37:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是要去…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weren't you about to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.83,1:37:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.83,1:37:47.83,Note,0,0,0,0,,（目标 纽约）
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.57,1:38:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,上来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.68,1:38:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it steady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.72,1:39:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.52,1:39:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,去杀了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.86,1:39:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不会吻你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not kissing you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.75,1:40:10.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（芝加哥）
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.75,1:40:12.65,Note,0,0,0,0,,（纽约）
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.95,1:42:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是怎么也不放弃是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't give up, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.21,1:42:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.86,1:44:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本可以拥有神的力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have the power of the gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.40,1:44:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为自己胸前顶着面旗子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet you wear a flag on your{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.12,1:44:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是为国而战了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}chest and think you fight a battle of nations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.70,1:44:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经看见了未来 队长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have seen the future, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.70,1:44:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 未来可没有国旗 - 这不是我的未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There are no flags. - Not my future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.51,1:44:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都干了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.31,1:44:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.00,1:45:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是罗杰斯队长 收到吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in this is, Captain Rogers. Do you read me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.38,1:45:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗杰斯队长 你…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Rogers, what is your…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.59,1:45:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂夫 是你吗 你没事吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve is that you, are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.96,1:45:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 施密特死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great, Schmidt's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.22,1:45:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞机呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the plane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.51,1:45:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个比较难解释{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a little bit tougher to explain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.35,1:45:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我坐标 我给你找个安全降落点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me your coordinates I'll find you a safe landing site.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.14,1:46:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能没功夫顾及安全了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not going to be a safe landing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.56,1:46:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要尝试迫降{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to try and force it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.15,1:46:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让霍华德来听 他知道怎么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get Howard on the line, he'll know what to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.36,1:46:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not enough time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.36,1:46:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这架飞机太快 正往纽约飞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing's moving too fast and it's heading for New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.57,1:46:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得让他落在海里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta put her in the water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.45,1:46:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 别这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, don't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.74,1:46:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间来得及 我们可以想想办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have time, we can work it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.79,1:46:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在无人地带{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now I'm in the middle of nowhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.21,1:46:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是不立即行动 会有很多人丧命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I wait any longer a lot of people are going to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.92,1:46:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩姬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peggy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.80,1:46:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.57,1:46:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩姬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peggy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.62,1:46:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.54,1:47:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来要改天和你跳舞了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to need a rain check on that dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.30,1:47:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.22,1:47:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,下周六在鹳鸟俱乐部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A week next Saturday at the Stork Club.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.10,1:47:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.23,1:47:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,八点整{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight o'clock, on the dot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.35,1:47:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准迟到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you dare be late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.86,1:47:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.73,1:47:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是不会跳舞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I still don't know how to dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.87,1:47:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会教你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll show you how.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.12,1:47:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来就好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just be there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.91,1:47:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得让乐队演奏柔缓的曲子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have the band play something slow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.79,1:47:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想踩到你的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd hate to step on your…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.47,1:47:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.72,1:47:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.43,1:48:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,史蒂夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.58,1:48:55.69,Note,0,0,0,0,,（欧洲胜利日）
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.58,1:49:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬队长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.59,1:49:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.77,1:49:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,去下一个坐标点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take us to the next grid point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.64,1:49:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这里没有残骸的痕迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's no trace of wreckage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.48,1:49:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,能量信号也在这终止了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the energy signal trace stops here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.23,1:49:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续找就是了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep looking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.03,1:49:53.07,Note,0,0,0,0,,（已退役）
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.76,1:50:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,又一记投球 是高飞界外球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a pitch, it's a ball high outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.14,1:50:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么与道奇队比分为四比四平手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the dodges tied four to four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.10,1:50:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,计分毫无悬念 他挥动球棒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the count no doubt, one swing of his bat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:55.69,1:50:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位小伙子有能力再次让对方三振出局{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This fella is capable of making it a brand new game again{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.74,1:51:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,本场在埃比茨棒球场进行的比赛太精彩了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just an absolutely gorgeous day here at Ebbets field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.86,1:51:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,费城人队把局面控制在四比四平手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phillies have managed to tie it up four to four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.79,1:51:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,而道奇队还有三人在场上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the Dodgers have three men on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.75,1:51:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,投球 好球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pitch, it's a strike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:21.47,1:51:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他屈起身 投球 挥棒 一道弧线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He leans in, here's the pitch, swung on, it's a line drive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.47,1:51:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,越过了格里姆森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It gets past Grissom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.43,1:51:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞佐得分了 雷瑟跑向三垒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rizzo will score, Reiser heads to third.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.85,1:51:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜罗歇在等着接替他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Durocher is going to wave him in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.60,1:51:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正要交接 但保持着稳定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They look to relay but they hold steady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.57,1:51:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得·雷瑟以一记投入公园的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pete Reiser with an inside the park…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:38.89,1:51:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good Morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.57,1:51:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者该说 下午好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or should I say, afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.03,1:51:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.49,1:51:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.16,1:51:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在纽约的一间术后恢复室里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in a recovery room in New York city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.29,1:51:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,道奇队以八比四领先了 道奇队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Dodgers take the lead, it's eight to four Oh ho, dodgers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.08,1:51:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是一场精彩绝伦的比赛啊 大家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a game we have here today, folks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.09,1:51:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,比赛确实不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine game indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.25,1:52:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到底在哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am I really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.05,1:52:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不太明白你的意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.76,1:52:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场比赛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.39,1:52:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是在1941年5月{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for May, 1941.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.80,1:52:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 因为我在现场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, 'cause I was there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.52,1:52:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再问你一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm going to ask you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.98,1:52:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到底在哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.15,1:52:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗杰斯队长 - 你是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Captain Rogers - Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.11,1:52:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗杰斯队长 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Rogers, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.70,1:52:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体特工注意 紧急警报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All agents, code 13.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.08,1:52:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,警报 全体特工注意 紧急警报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…13, all agents code 13.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.39,1:52:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张 大兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At ease, soldier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.45,1:53:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我为那场表演深感抱歉 但是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look I'm sorry about that little show back there, but.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:10.57,1:53:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们认为最好让你慢慢接受这些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought it best to break it to you slowly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.66,1:53:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,接受什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.41,1:53:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直在沉睡 队长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been asleep, Cap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.63,1:53:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡了大概七十年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For almost seventy years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:36.31,1:53:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna be okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.77,1:53:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.77,1:53:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 只是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.44,1:53:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我错过了个约会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a date.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:48.24,2:02:50.96,Title,0,0,0,0,,美国队长会在《复仇者联盟》中回归
Dialogue: 0,2:03:07.94,2:03:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡不着吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trouble sleeping?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:12.64,2:03:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是来说任务的吗 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're here with the mission, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:14.34,2:03:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:16.34,2:03:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,想让我回归这个世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to get me back to the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:19.34,2:03:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要拯救这个世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to save it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:29.54,2:03:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为这世上就你一个超级英雄吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you're the only hero in the world?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:46.14,2:03:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 准备行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, you are up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:49.14,2:03:52.16,Title,0,0,0,0,,《复仇者联盟》
Dialogue: 0,2:03:55.14,2:03:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺带感儿的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little bit swing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:11.50,1:56:18.90,Title,0,0,0,0,,《美国队长》
